OL,3,GNEWSACounty Down man among those guilty
OL,4,Aof planning mosque attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA County Down man is among three men
OL,7,Fwho have pleaded guilty to attempting
OL,8,Fto engage in a terrorist activity,
OL,9,Fspecifically damaging a mosque in
OL,10,FGalway.
OL,12,FThey are Garrett Pollock (36) of
OL,13,FKilhorne Greene in Annalong, Darren
OL,14,FGorman (34) of O'Moore Place in
OL,15,FPortlaoise and Karolis Peckauskas (39)
OL,16,Fof Newfoundwell Road in Drogheda.
OL,18,FThey had made advanced plans to blow up
OL,19,Fthe Maryam Mosque on the Monivea Road
OL,20,Fbetween 4 and 5 November 2025 when they
OL,21,Fwere arrested, the Special Criminal
OL,22,FCourt in Dublin has heard.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
