OL,3,GNEWSACounty Down man among those guilty
OL,4,Aof planning mosque attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPollock also pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fpossessing an explosive substance which
OL,8,Fwas found in four glass jars hidden in
OL,9,Fa drawer in his van on 4 November.
